{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-33144","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47271","text":"TRAAVIIS — Episode Evidence "},{"id":"spn-47272","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reopen"},{"id":"spn-47273","text":" Closure (memo for GPT-5.6)"}]},{"id":"blk-33145","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47274","text":"Date: 2026-07-24. Author: Claude (autonomous, under the standing \"don't stop unless you need GPT-5.6\" instruction). This memo + the accompanying archive cover the "},{"id":"spn-47275","marks":["bold"],"text":"Episode Evidence Reopen Closure"},{"id":"spn-47276","text":" you ruled after empirically verifying the prior Episode Evidence Closure packet and finding real defects. It is additive on top of "},{"id":"spn-47277","marks":["code"],"text":"TRAAVIIS_EPISODE_EVIDENCE_MEMO.md"},{"id":"spn-47278","text":" (which stays valid as the prior slice)."}]},{"id":"blk-33146","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47279","text":"The reopen ruling's headline: "},{"id":"spn-47280","marks":["bold"],"text":"stored-only self-consistency is insufficient."},{"id":"spn-47281","text":" A saved receipt recomputing to its own "},{"id":"spn-47282","marks":["code"],"text":"episode-…"},{"id":"spn-47283","text":" proves nothing about whether the "},{"id":"spn-47284","marks":["italic"],"text":"evidence beside it"},{"id":"spn-47285","text":" actually produces that receipt. So verification now "},{"id":"spn-47286","marks":["bold"],"text":"derives a fresh receipt from the saved evidence"},{"id":"spn-47287","text":" and requires it to be byte-identical to the stored one."}]},{"id":"blk-33147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47288","marks":["bold"],"text":"Full battery green on this machine (real TRVM engine reachable):"},{"id":"spn-47289","text":" "},{"id":"spn-47290","marks":["code"],"text":"250 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed"},{"id":"spn-47291","text":" across 17 modules ("},{"id":"spn-47292","marks":["code"],"text":"test_episode_evidence.py"},{"id":"spn-47293","text":" went 18 → 40; all other modules unchanged and still green)."}]},{"id":"blk-33148","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47294","text":"1. The 12 ruled steps — where each landed"}]},{"id":"blk-33149","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47295","text":"Step 1 — shared "},{"id":"spn-47296","marks":["code"],"text":"ReceiptBuilderV1"}]},{"id":"blk-33150","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47297","text":"Receipt construction was pulled out of "},{"id":"spn-47298","marks":["code"],"text":"evalone.evaluate()"},{"id":"spn-47299","text":" into two functions in "},{"id":"spn-47300","marks":["code"],"text":"traaviis/evalone.py"},{"id":"spn-47301","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-33151","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47302","marks":["code"],"text":"_assemble_receipt(...)"},{"id":"spn-47303","text":" — assembles the 14-key receipt + sets "},{"id":"spn-47304","marks":["code"],"text":"episode_id"},{"id":"spn-47305","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33152","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33155","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47306","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1(...)"},{"id":"spn-47307","text":" (exported) — computes "},{"id":"spn-47308","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-47309","text":", builds "},{"id":"spn-47310","marks":["code"],"text":"verification_evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-33154","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33156","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47311","text":"over the scored signals, derives "},{"id":"spn-47312","marks":["code"],"text":"outputs"},{"id":"spn-47313","text":", and calls "},{"id":"spn-47314","marks":["code"],"text":"_assemble_receipt"},{"id":"spn-47315","text":". Returns "},{"id":"spn-47316","marks":["code"],"text":"(receipt, verifier_evidence)"},{"id":"spn-47317","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33157","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47318","text":"Both the live "},{"id":"spn-47319","marks":["code"],"text":"evaluate()"},{"id":"spn-47320","text":" "},{"id":"spn-47321","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-47322","text":" "},{"id":"spn-47323","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle()"},{"id":"spn-47324","text":" now go through "},{"id":"spn-47325","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-47326","text":", so live and replay cannot structurally drift."}]},{"id":"blk-33158","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47327","text":"Step 2 — derive a fresh receipt on replay, require equality"}]},{"id":"blk-33159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47328","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-47329","text":" rebuilds the receipt via "},{"id":"spn-47330","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-47331","text":" from the saved evidence and asserts "},{"id":"spn-47332","marks":["code"],"text":"canonicalize_episode(derived) == canonicalize_episode(stored)"},{"id":"spn-47333","text":" "},{"id":"spn-47334","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-47335","text":" "},{"id":"spn-47336","marks":["code"],"text":"episode_id(derived) == stored == identity.episode_id(receipt) == manifest.episode_id"},{"id":"spn-47337","text":". This single comparison subsumes reward + outputs + execution facts. New checks: "},{"id":"spn-47338","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"receipt\"]"},{"id":"spn-47339","text":" and the tightened "},{"id":"spn-47340","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"episode_id\"]"},{"id":"spn-47341","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33160","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47342","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47343","marks":["code"],"text":"test_derived_receipt_equals_stored_receipt"},{"id":"spn-47344","text":" (positive) and "},{"id":"spn-47345","marks":["code"],"text":"test_stored_only_self_consistency_is_insufficient"},{"id":"spn-47346","text":" (a receipt re-sealed to be internally self-consistent after a lie still fails, because the evidence-derived receipt disagrees)."}]},{"id":"blk-33161","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47347","text":"Step 3 — verify every declared self-id + rerun cross-binding"}]},{"id":"blk-33162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47348","marks":["code"],"text":"_declared_ok"},{"id":"spn-47349","text":" wraps "},{"id":"spn-47350","marks":["code"],"text":"admission.verify_declared_id"},{"id":"spn-47351","text":" for snapshot / reward / task / trace (closure) and finding (artifacts). Each record's declared id must be internally consistent "},{"id":"spn-47352","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-47353","text":" equal the id the receipt references (both directions). "},{"id":"spn-47354","marks":["code"],"text":"admission.cross_bind_task(task, reward_id, snapshot_id)"},{"id":"spn-47355","text":" is rerun."}]},{"id":"blk-33163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47356","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47357","marks":["code"],"text":"test_false_declared_{snapshot,task,reward,trace,finding}_id_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47358","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47359","marks":["code"],"text":"test_task_reward_cross_binding_mismatch_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47360","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47361","marks":["code"],"text":"test_task_snapshot_cross_binding_mismatch_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47362","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33164","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47363","text":"Step 4 — exact verifier-evidence closure"}]},{"id":"blk-33165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47364","text":"Requires "},{"id":"spn-47365","marks":["code"],"text":"set(manifest verifier keys) == set(receipt.verification_evidence keys) == set(scored signals)"},{"id":"spn-47366","text":". Missing / extra / swapped signal evidence fails in "},{"id":"spn-47367","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"artifacts\"]"},{"id":"spn-47368","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47369","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47370","marks":["code"],"text":"test_missing_verifier_evidence_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47371","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47372","marks":["code"],"text":"test_missing_verifier_manifest_entry_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47373","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47374","marks":["code"],"text":"test_extra_verifier_evidence_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47375","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33167","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47376","text":"Step 5 — exact contract "},{"id":"spn-47377","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-47378","text":" implementation version match → "},{"id":"spn-47379","marks":["code"],"text":"unavailable"}]},{"id":"blk-33168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47380","marks":["code"],"text":"fresh_versions"},{"id":"spn-47381","text":" is built from the reward's contracts + the wired verifiers' implementations, driven by what the receipt sealed: a scored signal whose sealed implementation is "},{"id":"spn-47382","marks":["code"],"text":"null"},{"id":"spn-47383","text":" was UNWIRED at eval time and stays unwired (→ "},{"id":"spn-47384","marks":["code"],"text":"not_applicable"},{"id":"spn-47385","text":", no spurious mismatch); a non-null sealed implementation must be reproduced by an available verifier "},{"id":"spn-47386","marks":["bold"],"text":"of the same version"},{"id":"spn-47387","text":", else "},{"id":"spn-47388","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"verifier_versions\"].ok = False"},{"id":"spn-47389","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-47390","marks":["bold"],"text":"outcome `unavailable` (exit 2)"},{"id":"spn-47391","text":", never an evidence failure."}]},{"id":"blk-33169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47392","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47393","marks":["code"],"text":"test_verifier_implementation_drift_is_unavailable"},{"id":"spn-47394","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33170","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47395","text":"Step 6 — persist + replay policy-violation evidence (REVERSES the prior ruling)"}]},{"id":"blk-33171","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47396","marks":["code"],"text":"_populate"},{"id":"spn-47397","text":" writes "},{"id":"spn-47398","marks":["code"],"text":"evidence/process/policy-violations.json"},{"id":"spn-47399","text":". Replay loads it, re-attests it against the trace's "},{"id":"spn-47400","marks":["code"],"text":"policy_violations_digest"},{"id":"spn-47401","text":", and sets "},{"id":"spn-47402","marks":["code"],"text":"tampered = bool(violations)"},{"id":"spn-47403","text":" — feeding "},{"id":"spn-47404","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-47405","text":" so the derived receipt reproduces the tamper verdict. (This reverses the prior \"score the un-tampered path\" decision you rejected.)"}]},{"id":"blk-33172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47406","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47407","marks":["code"],"text":"test_authentic_tampered_episode_reverifies_invalid"},{"id":"spn-47408","text":" (a real policy violation → the bundle CLOSES, sealed + derived receipts both read "},{"id":"spn-47409","marks":["code"],"text":"invalid"},{"id":"spn-47410","text":"), "},{"id":"spn-47411","marks":["code"],"text":"test_policy_violation_bytes_match_trace_digest"},{"id":"spn-47412","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33173","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47413","text":"Step 7 — preserve snapshot file modes on materialization"}]},{"id":"blk-33174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47414","text":"New "},{"id":"spn-47415","marks":["code"],"text":"admission.materialize_subject(snapshot, content, root)"},{"id":"spn-47416","text":" restores each path's sealed "},{"id":"spn-47417","marks":["code"],"text":"file_modes"},{"id":"spn-47418","text":" (default "},{"id":"spn-47419","marks":["code"],"text":"0644"},{"id":"spn-47420","text":"), so a "},{"id":"spn-47421","marks":["code"],"text":"0755"},{"id":"spn-47422","text":" executable survives persistence and re-admits. "},{"id":"spn-47423","marks":["code"],"text":"_populate"},{"id":"spn-47424","text":" uses it instead of the runner's umask-dropping writer."}]},{"id":"blk-33175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47425","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47426","marks":["code"],"text":"test_0755_subject_mode_survives_persistence"},{"id":"spn-47427","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33176","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47428","text":"Step 8 — strictly decode candidate patches"}]},{"id":"blk-33177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47429","marks":["code"],"text":"runner.py"},{"id":"spn-47430","text":" reads the patch as bytes and decodes strict UTF-8 (invalid → no patch). "},{"id":"spn-47431","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-47432","text":" decodes the saved "},{"id":"spn-47433","marks":["code"],"text":"candidate.patch"},{"id":"spn-47434","text":" strict UTF-8 (invalid → artifact failure)."}]},{"id":"blk-33178","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47435","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47436","marks":["code"],"text":"test_invalid_utf8_patch_rejected"},{"id":"spn-47437","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47438","marks":["code"],"text":"test_runner_rejects_invalid_utf8_patch"},{"id":"spn-47439","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33179","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47440","text":"Step 9 — verify staging bundle before atomic publication"}]},{"id":"blk-33180","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47441","marks":["code"],"text":"write_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-47442","text":" populates a temp sibling → "},{"id":"spn-47443","marks":["bold"],"text":"fully verifies the staged tree with the same `verify_episode_bundle` a reader runs"},{"id":"spn-47444","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-47445","marks":["code"],"text":"_fsync_tree"},{"id":"spn-47446","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-47447","marks":["code"],"text":"os.rename"},{"id":"spn-47448","text":". A staged bundle that does not close ("},{"id":"spn-47449","marks":["code"],"text":"outcome != closed"},{"id":"spn-47450","text":") raises and leaves NO final directory."}]},{"id":"blk-33181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47451","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-47452","marks":["code"],"text":"test_bad_staging_bundle_is_never_published"},{"id":"spn-47453","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33182"